Look for the bare necessities

190
00:13:33,938 --> 00:13:36,314
The simple bare necessities

191
00:13:36,357 --> 00:13:39,818
Forget about
your worries and your strife

192
00:13:39,902 --> 00:13:43,154
Yeah, I mean the...

193
